# round 86 (w104): the single-experiment recipe on the ten repeated outer splits. Round 83 showed that keeping only the YPD ratio beside the YPD solve vector and the gene-rule counts costs 0.002 on the released split; this asks whether that holds on ten other held-out fifths. Three seeds per split, read fixed here: the per-split seed mean against w96 (the four-media recipe, three seeds per split) and against w93 (the vector without the counts), paired by split.
